  Becoming.Turnover.web.requires 0 (Becoming.turn Becoming.Turnover.swap b f) Becoming.Turnover.Condition.pool →
    ¬Becoming.Turnover.web.requires 0 (Becoming.turn Becoming.Turnover.swap (!b) f) Becoming.Turnover.Condition.pool
