  (before : W.active t g) : Becoming.«有后» (Becoming.Web.continuationStep R) W.activityClass (t, g) ↔ W.Continued R t g
Becoming.Web.itself_carries_nothing {F C : Type} {W : Becoming.Web F C} (z w : Nat × F) :
